      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Transformations are lazy - only the action (write) triggers a job.\ngroupBy + orderBy = TWO shuffles -> THREE stages. One action = one job.",
      "rawText": "Transformations are lazy - only the action (write) triggers a job.\ngroupBy + orderBy = TWO shuffles -> THREE stages. One action = one job.",
