      "type": "text",
      "roundness": null,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "spark-submit -> driver (SparkContext) -> DAGScheduler splits the job at shuffle boundaries ->\nTaskScheduler + SchedulerBackend send serialized tasks to executor slots -> each task computes one\npartition -> shuffle write (data + index files) -> all-to-all fetch -> merge / aggregate -> result or\noutput -> retries up to spark.task.maxFailures, stage re-submit on FetchFailed -> AQE may re-optimize\nat runtime.",
      "rawText": "spark-submit -> driver (SparkContext) -> DAGScheduler splits the job at shuffle boundaries ->\nTaskScheduler + SchedulerBackend send serialized tasks to executor slots -> each task computes one\npartition -> shuffle write (data + index files) -> all-to-all fetch -> merge / aggregate -> result or\noutput -> retries up to spark.task.maxFailures, stage re-submit on FetchFailed -> AQE may re-optimize\nat runtime.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "spark-submit -> driver (SparkContext) -> DAGScheduler splits the job at shuffle boundaries -> TaskScheduler + SchedulerBackend send serialized tasks to executor slots -> each task computes one partition -> shuffle write (data + index files) -> all-to-all fetch -> merge / aggregate -> result or output -> retries up to spark.task.maxFailures, stage re-submit on FetchFailed -> AQE may re-optimize at runtime.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
